CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ constructible from an lvalue \(S\(T&\) binds, deleted S\(T&&\) not\): SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
N5008 [meta.unary.prop]: is_constructible<T, Args...> uses declval<Args>(),
whose value category is an lvalue iff Arg is an lvalue reference.  Regression
test for the __is_constructible intrinsic dropping the argument's value
category, which reported is_constructible<reference_wrapper<const int>, int&>
false (breaking std::optional<reference_wrapper<...>> in simplify_utils.cpp).
Non-vacuous: assertion.2 must FAIL.
